config BR2_PACKAGE_HEXA_MAX98390
	bool "hexa-max98390"
	depends on BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
	help
	  Driver for the four Maxim MAX98390 speaker amplifiers of the
	  Samsung Galaxy Book4 Pro/Ultra and Book5 laptops (the kernel
	  has none yet, so the speakers stay silent; headphones work).
	  Out-of-tree build of the driver from thesofproject/linux
	  PR #5616, as packaged by Andycodeman. /etc/init.d/S12speakers
	  creates the three amplifiers that ACPI does not declare.

	  https://github.com/Andycodeman/samsung-galaxy-book-linux-fixes

comment "hexa-max98390 needs a Linux kernel to be built"
	depends on !BR2_LINUX_KERNEL
